{
  "_comment": "cc-switch, which the agent runs as each account to point the machine's AI tools at the gateway. It is no module: is_module is false, so it stays out of the catalog, and the agent opens package {module: cc_switch} for it when its ai_tools section needs a copy. The version, each asset and each sha256 are the client's pin, PACKAGING_CC_SWITCH_* in packaging/shared/constants.py, which a hub test holds this file to. Each url is the publisher's GitHub release, and each cn_url the same file under its upstream name on the project's own release, {release} being the address this hub's build stamped for its agent packages; the mainland release keeps its latest files alone, so a cn hub older than that finds the file gone and answers hub_release_file_gone.",
